{"content":[{"c":["ARD, ARDITE"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["One of the nine sons of Bela (",{"href":"?bref=Num.26.40","r":"Num.26.40","rawR":"Num.26.40","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.26.40","value":"Num.26.40"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 26:40"},"), Benjamin’s firstborn son (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.1","r":"1Chr.8.1","rawR":"1Chr.8.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.1","value":"1Chr.8.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:1"},"). Ard is called Benjamin’s son in the Hebrew sense, meaning descendant (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.46.21","r":"Gen.46.21","rawR":"Gen.46.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.46.21","value":"Gen.46.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 46:21"},"). He was the founder of the Ardite family, a subclan of Benjamin’s tribe. The Ard/Addar transposition in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.3","r":"1Chr.8.3","rawR":"1Chr.8.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.3","value":"1Chr.8.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 8:3"}," is probably a result of scribal error."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"ArdArdite","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Nm 26:40","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.26.40","rawQueryValue":"Num.26.40","sourceRefExact":"Num.26.40"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.1","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.1","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.1"},{"anchorText":"Gn 46:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.46.21","rawQueryValue":"Gen.46.21","sourceRefExact":"Gen.46.21"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 8:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.3","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.3","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.3"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"7ebc353f5637de2e8c217573a1c7fd2167af0ee30781a845bb1ce3691ae4650e","sourceItemName":"ArdArdite","sourceItemOrder":465,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"ArdArdite","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Ard, Ardite","title":"Ard, Ardite","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}